{"id":"level-up-2026-10-25","name":"2026-10-25 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1851","en":"Too many simultaneous requests can overwhelm the booking system.","zh":"过多同时发出的请求可能使预订系统不堪重负。","note":"overwhelm · 征服； 淹没 · overwhelm a system","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1852","en":"A design consultant helped us improve the exhibition layout.","zh":"一位设计顾问帮助我们改进了展览布局。","note":"consultant · 顾问； 专科医生 · a design consultant","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1853","en":"Tests revealed a chemical contaminant in the water sample.","zh":"检测发现水样中含有一种化学污染物。","note":"contaminant · 致污物， 污染物 · a chemical contaminant","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1854","en":"Her charcoal drawing captures the shadows around the old doorway.","zh":"她的木炭画捕捉了旧门口周围的阴影。","note":"charcoal · 炭， 木炭 · a charcoal drawing","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1855","en":"A detailed illustration shows how the wooden joints fit together.","zh":"一幅详细的插图展示了木制接头如何组接。","note":"illustration · 说明； 实例； 图解， 插图 · a detailed illustration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1856","en":"Wrap the glass bowl carefully before placing it in the box.","zh":"把玻璃碗放进箱子前，要仔细包好。","note":"wrap · 裹； 包； 缠绕 · wrap carefully","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1857","en":"The local festival gained prominence after appearing on national television.","zh":"这个地方节庆登上全国电视节目后提高了知名度。","note":"prominence · 突出， 显著； 卓越； 重要 · gain prominence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1858","en":"The workshop maintains a high standard of craftsmanship.","zh":"这个工作坊保持着高水准的工艺。","note":"standard · 标准的；标准 · a high standard","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1859","en":"The project explores how neighbours can live in greater harmony.","zh":"该项目探索邻居之间如何更和睦地生活。","note":"harmony · 相符， 一致； 和谐， 融洽； 【音】 和声 · live in harmony","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1860","en":"Moving the meeting online seemed an acceptable solution to everyone.","zh":"把会议转到线上似乎是大家都能接受的解决办法。","note":"acceptable · 可接受的 · an acceptable solution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1861","en":"Chill the dessert before serving it with fresh berries.","zh":"把甜点冷藏后，再配上新鲜浆果端上桌。","note":"chill · 变冷，；寒冷的； 扫兴的 · chill the dessert","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1862","en":"The anniversary dinner allowed her to reunite with former classmates.","zh":"周年晚宴让她得以与昔日同学重聚。","note":"reunite · 结合； 重聚 · reunite with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1863","en":"Two tall chimneys dominate the skyline above the old factory.","zh":"两根高烟囱耸立在旧工厂上方的天际线上。","note":"dominate · 支配， 统治； 耸立于 · dominate the skyline","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1864","en":"The children tried to imitate the sound of falling rain.","zh":"孩子们试着模仿雨落下的声音。","note":"imitate · 模仿， 模拟； 仿效 · imitate a sound","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1865","en":"The library is a public institution funded by local taxes.","zh":"图书馆是由地方税收资助的公共机构。","note":"institution · 协会； 机构； 制度； 习俗； 团体； 设立， 制定 · a public institution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1866","en":"I kept a small writing pad beside the telephone.","zh":"我在电话旁放了一本小便笺本。","note":"pad · 填塞； 蹑手蹑脚地走；软垫；便笺本 · a writing pad","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1867","en":"Travelling across the desert fulfilled his lifelong ambition.","zh":"穿越沙漠实现了他毕生的抱负。","note":"ambition · 雄心， 抱负； 野心 · a lifelong ambition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1868","en":"The accounts team reviewed several delinquent payments before contacting customers.","zh":"财务团队联系客户之前，核查了几笔拖欠的付款。","note":"delinquent · 失职的；违法的；拖欠的；违法者， 罪犯 · delinquent payments","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1869","en":"The quality of the students' final work exceeded our expectations.","zh":"学生最终作品的质量超出了我们的预期。","note":"exceed · 超过， 胜过 · exceed expectations","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1870","en":"You can enlarge the image to examine the tiny details.","zh":"你可以放大图像，查看细小的细节。","note":"enlarge · 扩大， 放大， 扩充 · enlarge an image","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1871","en":"The independent bookshop depends on local patronage to stay open.","zh":"这家独立书店依靠当地顾客的光顾维持营业。","note":"patronage · 赞助； 支持； 光顾； 任免权 · local patronage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1872","en":"A shared interest in gardening helped us start a conversation.","zh":"对园艺的共同兴趣帮助我们打开了话题。","note":"conversation · 会话， 谈话 · start a conversation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1873","en":"She borrowed a murder mystery to read on the train.","zh":"她借了一本凶杀推理小说，准备在火车上读。","note":"murder · 谋杀， 凶杀 · a murder mystery","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1874","en":"The delayed shipment left the workshop without enough materials.","zh":"货物运输延误使工作坊的材料不足。","note":"shipment · 装运， 运输； 装载的货物， 装货量 · a delayed shipment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1875","en":"Poor maintenance and falling income created a vicious cycle.","zh":"维护不善和收入下降形成了恶性循环。","note":"vicious · 罪恶的， 邪恶的； 残酷的， 残忍的； 凶猛的； 恶性的 · a vicious cycle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1876","en":"The novel describes a young traveller's growing sense of alienation.","zh":"这部小说描写了一名年轻旅行者日益加深的疏离感。","note":"alienation · 疏远； 离间 · a sense of alienation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1877","en":"Preparing the archive required an enormous amount of patient work.","zh":"整理档案需要付出大量耐心细致的劳动。","note":"enormous · 巨大的， 庞大的， 极大的 · an enormous amount","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1878","en":"A family homestay helped her practise Spanish outside the classroom.","zh":"在当地家庭寄宿帮助她在课堂之外练习西班牙语。","note":"homestay · 在当地居民家居住的时期 · a family homestay","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1879","en":"The exhibition sparked a revival of interest in traditional weaving.","zh":"这次展览重新激发了人们对传统编织的兴趣。","note":"revival · 恢复， 复原； 苏醒， 复活； 复兴； 重新使用； 重新流行 · a revival of interest","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1880","en":"A lack of clear signs made the station difficult to navigate.","zh":"缺少清晰标牌，使人在车站里难以辨认方向。","note":"lack · 缺乏， 不足， 没有 · a lack of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1881","en":"They arrived at the reunion with a bouncing baby boy.","zh":"他们带着一个健壮的男婴参加了团聚活动。","note":"bouncing · 健壮的， 茁壮的 · a bouncing baby","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1882","en":"Cracks had appeared in the building's external wall.","zh":"建筑的外墙上出现了裂缝。","note":"external · 外面的， 表面的 · an external wall","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1883","en":"A thin copper wire connected the battery to the bulb.","zh":"一根细铜线将电池和灯泡连接起来。","note":"wire · 金属丝； 电线 · a copper wire","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1884","en":"Under the circumstances, postponing the picnic seemed the best choice.","zh":"在当时的情况下，推迟野餐似乎是最好的选择。","note":"circumstance · 环境； · under the circumstances","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1885","en":"Confusing the two identical folders was an excusable mistake.","zh":"把两个一模一样的文件夹弄混，是可以谅解的错误。","note":"excusable · 可原谅的； 可谅解的； 可容许的 · an excusable mistake","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1886","en":"She will revise the draft after discussing it with her tutor.","zh":"她会在与导师讨论后修改草稿。","note":"revise · 修订； 复习 · revise a draft","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1887","en":"The local authority agreed to improve lighting near the station.","zh":"地方当局同意改善车站附近的照明。","note":"authority · 权力，管辖权； · local authority","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1888","en":"It is easy to misjudge distances when walking in fog.","zh":"在雾中行走时，很容易误判距离。","note":"misjudge · 判断错误 · misjudge a distance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1889","en":"Visitor safety is of paramount importance during the renovation.","zh":"翻修期间，访客安全至关重要。","note":"paramount · 最重要的，决定性的；最高统治者 · of paramount importance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1890","en":"The new timetable applies from Monday onwards until further notice.","zh":"新时间表从周一起执行，直至另行通知。","note":"onwards · 向前地， 前进地 · from Monday onwards","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1891","en":"The longitudinal study followed the same students for five years.","zh":"这项纵向研究对同一批学生追踪了五年。","note":"longitudinal · 经度的， 经线的； 纵的； 长度的 · a longitudinal study","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1892","en":"A chink of light shone beneath the closed door.","zh":"一缕光从紧闭的门底下透出来。","note":"chink · 发出叮当声；裂缝，裂口；一缕光；叮当声 · a chink of light","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1893","en":"My sociable neighbour enjoys inviting new residents for coffee.","zh":"我那位好交际的邻居喜欢邀请新住户喝咖啡。","note":"sociable · 友善的， 友好的； 好交际的， 合群的 · a sociable person","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1894","en":"The research examines regional differences in access to public transport.","zh":"这项研究考察不同地区在公共交通可达性上的差异。","note":"regional · 局部范围的； 地方的， 区域性的； 全地区的， 整个地区的 · regional differences","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1895","en":"During the hottest hours, many guests took a short siesta.","zh":"在最热的时段，许多客人小睡了一会儿。","note":"siesta · 午睡， 午休 · take a siesta","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1896","en":"Finding the newly planted trees damaged was a dispiriting experience.","zh":"发现新种的树受损，令人感到沮丧。","note":"dispiriting · 令人沮丧的， 使人气馁的 · a dispiriting experience","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1897","en":"In the play, the prince vows to avenge his father's death.","zh":"剧中，王子发誓要为父亲之死报仇。","note":"avenge · 报仇， 复仇， 向报仇 · avenge a death","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1898","en":"Each child could choose a musical instrument to try.","zh":"每个孩子都可以选择一种乐器试奏。","note":"instrument · 仪器； 手段； 工具； 乐器 · a musical instrument","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1899","en":"The artist uses clay as a medium for exploring movement.","zh":"这位艺术家以黏土为媒介，探索运动的表现。","note":"medium · 媒质，媒介；工具，手段； · a creative medium","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:s1900","en":"The simplified interface makes the booking system easier to use.","zh":"简化后的界面让预订系统更容易使用。","note":"interface · 界面； 接口； 接合点 · a user interface","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:w1851","en":"overwhelm","zh":"征服； 淹没","note":"英 /ˌəuvə'welm/ · 美 /ovɚˈhwɛlm/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1851-uk-0519318a5de8.mp3","text":"overwhelm"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1851-us-c39a05ec7582.mp3","text":"overwhelm"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:w1852","en":"consultant","zh":"顾问； 专科医生","note":"英 /kən'sʌltənt/ · 美 /kən'sʌltənt/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1852-uk-35e9e0d18a40.mp3","text":"consultant"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1852-us-80ae699f1bff.mp3","text":"consultant"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-25:w1853","en":"contaminant","zh":"致污物， 污染物","note":"英 /kən'tæmɪnənt/ · 美 /kən'tæmɪnənt/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1853-uk-bb1886cd2c4a.mp3","text":"contaminant"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-